The files in this directory that contain Grimme D3 reference data --
specifically:

    d3_c6ref.dat    reference C6 coefficients indexed by (Z_A, Z_B, CN_A, CN_B)
    d3_atomic.dat   per-element covalent radii and <r^4>/<r^2> factors

-- are derived from the Fortran libraries simple-dftd3 and mctc-lib,
distributed by the Grimme group (Mulliken Center for Theoretical Chemistry,
University of Bonn).  The numerical values were extracted verbatim from the
compiled shared library shipped with the pypi package 'dftd3', by calling
the library's exported symbols

    mctc_data_covrad::get_covalent_rad_num
    dftd3_data_r4r2::get_r4r2_val_num
    dftd3_reference::get_c6

through Python ctypes.  No translation, rounding, or interpolation was
applied.

